    "body": "Closed as work already done: the defect is fixed on `main` by 84583da67 (#760). The post engine refuses a non-finite `OriginX` or `OriginY` by name before any script hook runs, and `crates/app/src/posting.rs:699-700` shows the refusal to the user. The verification on f4b351682 is comment 7074410891: 14 cases, all refused, no NC file. No pin test is in the tree yet; 3286 tracks the pin.",
